WEBVTT

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:36.900 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.950 line:0%
[Episode 6]

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:42.880 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.290 line:0%
People

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.440 line:0%
can't always expect

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.160 line:0%
others to lend a helping hand.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.290 line:0%
When you can do it yourself,

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.120 line:0%
it's better to rely on yourself.

00:02:17.879 --> 00:02:19.740 line:0%
A servant from the Yan's Mansion.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:23.920 line:0%
Miss Xing,

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.440 line:0%
Master asked me to remind you

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.920 line:0%
that the three days have already passed.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.000 line:0%
The day for your returning home

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.080 line:0%
has been delayed again and again.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.560 line:0%
You said before that you'd return tomorrow,

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.660 line:0%
but this time you can't change your mind again.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:33.640 line:0%
Alright,

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.600 line:0%
I understand.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:49.890 line:0%
Xing.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.640 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.940 line:0%
The whole Xiang'an City is talking about

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:54.760 line:0%
that the Grand Commander and you are deeply in love.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.540 line:0%
It makes my face

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.080 line:0%
shine with pride.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:58.970 line:0%
Beautiful.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.100 line:0%
Really beautiful.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.040 line:0%
Delicious. Isn't it?

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.060 line:0%
Beautiful.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:10.090 line:0%
Really beautiful.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:14.400 line:0%
Xing.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.080 line:0%
You're finally back.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:17.280 line:0%
Why have you been alone

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.350 line:0%
all this time?

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.760 line:0%
Where's your husband?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:20.560 line:0%
He

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.920 line:0%
has urgent business at the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.180 line:0%
The case is important.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:24.600 line:0%
The case

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.120 line:0%
can't be more important than you.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.970 line:0%
[Yan Yijiao, fourth daughter of the Yan family]

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.280 line:0%
How can a married woman

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.080 line:0%
return to her maiden home alone?

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:35.280 line:0%
He'll come when he's finished.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.040 line:0%
Right?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:42.800 line:0%
Yijiao,

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.280 line:0%
why did you come back today?

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:44.960 line:0%
You didn't come

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.620 line:0%
just to see me return, did you?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.160 line:0%
The bracelet your fourth brother-in-law ordered for me

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.160 line:0%
has just arrived.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.600 line:0%
I'm passing by to see you.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:54.080 line:0%
How about you?

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:02.160 line:0%
Look at my bracelet.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.360 line:0%
Isn't it beautiful?

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:05.040 line:0%
I fell in love with it at first sight.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.360 line:0%
No matter what unpleasant things she says,

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.840 line:0%
just ignore her.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.880 line:0%
What's so beautiful about it?

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.210 line:0%
She's just showing off.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.280 line:0%
Why didn't the fourth brother-in-law come?

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:15.860 line:0%
[Yan Mojie, the fifth son of the Yan family]

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:18.920 line:0%
Well,

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:19.960 line:0%
your brother-in-law had your sister

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.889 line:0%
bring a lot of pastries and fruits.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.180 line:0%
Everyone, please help yourselves.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:34.600 line:0%
Here, Honey.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:37.780 line:0%
Master,

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.720 line:0%
our Xing's life

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.280 line:0%
is so bitter.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.200 line:0%
Others marry well and live well.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.240 line:0%
Our Xing

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:48.430 line:0%
still has to find a way to make a living for others.

00:04:56.459 --> 00:04:57.320 line:0%
You...

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.580 line:0%
Where are you going with this talk again?

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.480 line:0%
That means I, as a mother,

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.940 line:0%
am not good enough, right?

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.120 line:0%
Look at me.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.600 line:0%
Apart from dressing up,

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.000 line:0%
I can't do anything else.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.920 line:0%
I don't do any work on a daily basis,

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.580 line:0%
yet my husband always praises me as a lucky star.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:25.780 line:0%
I originally wanted to have a daughter,

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.170 line:0%
to have a little cotton jacket.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.160 line:0%
Who would have thought

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.200 line:0%
I'd give birth to a pair of chubby twin boys?

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.120 line:0%
You have no idea

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:34.030 line:0%
how naughty that younger one is.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:36.680 line:0%
Xing.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.800 line:0%
You should get closer to your Fourth Sister.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.500 line:0%
Take advantage of her good fortune.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.360 line:0%
Don't just focus on work all day.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.320 line:0%
You're married now, stop running around everywhere.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.080 line:0%
That's right.

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:45.600 line:0%
Xing,

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.800 line:0%
you should quickly leave that Ministry of Justice

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:47.890 line:0%
and stop doing odd jobs.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.160 line:0%
Let me tell you something.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.160 line:0%
If a woman

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.840 line:0%
wants to change her life,

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:52.900 line:0%
what should she do?

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.840 line:0%
She should manage the inner court of the Shen's Mansion well.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:02.140 line:0%
Mojie.

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:04.320 line:0%
I heard from my colleagues in the Ministry of Justice

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:05.120 line:0%
that last time

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.160 line:0%
during a patrol in the red-light district,

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.600 line:0%
they saw you drinking with courtesans.

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.640 line:0%
You were also chasing after those girls

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.370 line:0%
and running all over the house.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.240 line:0%
Nonsense.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.280 line:0%
You spoiled brat, how dare you criticize me?

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:19.200 line:0%
The most disgraceful person in the family

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:19.920 line:0%
is you.

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:21.680 line:0%
Look at how bitter and sarcastic you are.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.200 line:0%
Tell me,

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:23.520 line:0%
where's your femininity?

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:25.420 line:0%
I'm bitter and sarcastic?

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:26.880 line:0%
If I were your husband,

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:27.920 line:0%
I'd go to the red-light district every day

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.050 line:0%
rather than see you.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:29.880 line:0%
What are you talking about?

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:30.640 line:0%
Enough.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.900 line:0%
The Grand Commander has arrived.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.000 line:0%
Grand Commander, you are here.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.270 line:0%
But I think

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:57.370 line:0%
my wife is wonderful.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.860 line:0%
I apologize for being late due to my busy official duties.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.760 line:0%
Father-in-law, Mother-in-law,

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.180 line:0%
please forgive me.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:22.880 line:0%
Not late at all.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.460 line:0%
You're just in time.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.560 line:0%
Yes, indeed.

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:48.580 line:0%
Today, Xing returns to her maiden home.

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:50.390 line:0%
I must express my deep gratitude to the Yan family

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:52.250 line:0%
for raising such a fine daughter.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:55.800 line:0%
Only then could I have

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:58.130 line:0%
such an exceptionally intelligent wife.

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:03.480 line:0%
Come in.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:27.290 line:0%
Father-in-law,

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.430 line:0%
I heard from Xing

00:08:32.709 --> 00:08:34.589 line:0%
that you enjoy tea tasting.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.960 line:0%
This is a porcelain cup with a glazed sunflower pattern.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.220 line:0%
It's from the Yue Kiln.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.850 line:0%
This is imperial Purple Shoot tea.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:55.960 line:0%
It's too precious.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.510 line:0%
It's too precious.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:00.460 line:0%
The Shen family is truly blessed to have Xing.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.980 line:0%
Even Her Highness, the Princess Ying, said

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.520 line:0%
I have married an excellent wife.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.760 line:0%
Her Highness, the Princess Ying?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.530 line:0%
[Tao Te Ching, Chapter 2, by Pan Yanzhi, Early Autumn of the Renyin Year]

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:38.050 line:0%
Pan Yanzhi?

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.270 line:0%
[Tao Te Ching, Chapter 2, by Pan Yanzhi, Early Autumn of the Renyin Year]

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.000 line:0%
Haven't his calligraphy and paintings

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.560 line:0%
already disappeared?

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.200 line:0%
They're imitations.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.320 line:0%
A few years ago, I

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.010 line:0%
happened to obtain a rubbing of Pan Yanzhi's work.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:54.690 line:0%
On a whim, I studied it for a bit.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.960 line:0%
Even you find it unbelievable.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:00.160 line:0%
It must be truly lifelike then.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:04.630 line:0%
[Tao Te Ching, Chapter 2, by Pan Yanzhi, Early Autumn of the Renyin Year]

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:03.090 line:0%
It seems your skill in imitating handwriting

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.430 line:0%
was learned from my father-in-law.

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:06.600 line:0%
I've only

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.080 line:0%
scratched the surface.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.400 line:0%
However,

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:10.400 line:0%
in this world,

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.280 line:0%
there's no calligraphy

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.680 line:0%
my father can't imitate.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.040 line:0%
It's just practice,

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.760 line:0%
not worth mentioning.

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:21.800 line:0%
Come, come, my good son-in-law,

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.840 line:0%
let's eat together.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:26.100 line:0%
Come, come, my good son-in-law, come on.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:29.560 line:0%
Let's eat.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:30.350 line:0%
Father,

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:31.680 line:0%
let's return to our residence.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:34.080 line:0%
There are still some important matters...

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.640 line:0%
Since it's my esteemed father-in-law's invitation,

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:39.400 line:0%
of course I should

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.680 line:0%
stay for the meal.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.330 line:0%
However, later on,

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:47.890 line:0%
I need to return home early.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.520 line:0%
I have some important business to take care of.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:55.330 line:0%
I understand.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:57.150 line:0%
I understand completely.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:44.920 line:0%
Xing.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:48.060 line:0%
I'm glad to see you're doing well now,

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:50.060 line:0%
which brings joy to my heart.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:51.890 line:0%
However...

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:55.050 line:0%
Has Prime Minister Zhang approached you?

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.550 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang has hinted several times,

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.990 line:0%
and his meaning is quite clear.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:01.760 line:0%
The position for the envoy to Xichen

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.160 line:0%
hasn't been decided yet.

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.740 line:0%
If his matter cannot be resolved,

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:06.880 line:0%
then...

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:09.520 line:0%
Regarding Prime Minister Zhang,

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.650 line:0%
I will give him an explanation myself.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.430 line:0%
The pigeons' large feathers are soft and fluffy.

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:49.490 line:0%
There are still quite a few fallen feathers in the cage.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:51.120 line:0%
This...

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:00.380 line:0%
Yaya, shut up.

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:02.080 line:0%
[The case of the monk's adultery]

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:07.320 line:0%
Grand Commander?

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.480 line:0%
Grand Commander?

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.320 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.720 line:0%
Someone has gone to the pigeon coop.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:23.440 line:0%
Who is it?

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:24.400 line:0%
It's...

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:25.960 line:0%
Madam.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.620 line:0%
She has made her choice after all.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:31.340 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:56.890 line:0%
Sir,

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.360 line:0%
a few days ago,

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.080 line:0%
you asked me to prepare the curtains.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.400 line:0%
They are ready now.

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.350 line:0%
This is a specially made fabric

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:13.390 line:0%
from Xichen,

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.720 line:0%
which can effectively block light.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.440 line:0%
Grand Commander

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.170 line:0%
specifically asked me...

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:30.410 line:0%
It's just right to use it

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:40.380 line:0%
for sword practice.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.270 line:0%
What a waste.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.250 line:0%
Your unpredictable temper

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.730 line:0%
really needs to change.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:07.180 line:0%
Otherwise, who would be willing to serve you in the future?

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:09.400 line:0%
Who was it at the Yan's Mansion

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.730 line:0%
that solemnly promised

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.440 line:0%
to serve me well?

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.930 line:0%
Honey, if you avoid me like this,

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.920 line:0%
how can you serve me well?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.260 line:0%
Do you really want me to serve you?

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.660 line:0%
We are husband and wife after all.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.950 line:0%
Even if something happens,

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:09.720 line:0%
no one will gossip about it.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:15.440 line:0%
Am I still afraid of gossip?

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.170 line:0%
A wife serving her husband

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.840 line:0%
is only natural and proper.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.890 line:0%
If you want me to serve you, then let me do it.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.480 line:0%
Who's afraid of whom?

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:46.560 line:0%
Honey, you smell so good.

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.020 line:0%
Do you want to smell me too

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.480 line:0%
and see if I smell good too?

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:20.810 line:0%
You dare to challenge me?

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:37.660 line:0%
Someone come here.

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:39.160 line:0%
Brighten the place

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.000 line:0%
where my wife is.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.240 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.170 line:0%
there's trouble at Ximing Temple.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.360 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau has enough manpower.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.200 line:0%
Grand Commander

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.280 line:0%
asked you to return to your duties at the Ministry of Justice.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.080 line:0%
I...

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:19.740 line:0%
Do you think I have to follow you?

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:20.820 line:0%
If you're so capable,

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.220 line:0%
don't come back begging me to investigate.

00:18:34.970 --> 00:18:36.700 line:0%
[The Buddha lantern burns, the sin is cleared.]

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.040 line:0%
The handwriting is neat.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:44.890 line:0%
The calligraphy is outstanding.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:45.960 line:0%
These bloody characters

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.960 line:0%
appeared on the wall out of nowhere.

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:52.660 line:0%
[Cleared]

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:00.620 line:0%
It's not blood.

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.270 line:0%
It's a special type of stone

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.340 line:0%
mixed with cinnabar to make ink.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.130 line:0%
It doesn't show color immediately after being applied to the wall.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.630 line:0%
After being washed by rain,

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:09.360 line:0%
it reveals a blood-like color.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:10.820 line:0%
The culprit had written it long ago,

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:12.820 line:0%
just waiting for last night's rain.

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:14.560 line:0%
On the statue in the main hall,

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.160 line:0%
there are also bloody tears.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:17.910 line:0%
Why would the culprit do this?

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.510 line:0%
[The Buddha lantern burns, the sin is cleared.]

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:27.830 line:0%
He's challenging us.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:29.240 line:0%
The Buddhas are angry,

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:30.370 line:0%
hence the bleeding.

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.160 line:0%
I heard

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.280 line:0%
the statue sheds bloody tears

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.760 line:0%
because the Buddhas lament the coldness of this world.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.640 line:0%
This is a warning to all mankind.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.410 line:0%
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:15.200 line:0%
I wasn't paying attention.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.120 line:0%
I didn't see.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:25.670 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:27.000 line:0%
You know, our Ministry of Justice

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.770 line:0%
really can't function without you.

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:29.900 line:0%
You have no idea,

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:31.080 line:0%
a while ago,

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.540 line:0%
the floors of our Ministry

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.660 line:0%
weren't even this shiny.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:44.570 line:0%
Sir.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:46.920 line:0%
Good morning, sir.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.780 line:0%
Isn't this the Grand Commander's wife?

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.870 line:0%
Why is she mopping the floor here?

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.440 line:0%
Indeed.

00:20:57.710 --> 00:20:59.110 line:0%
I can't bear it.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:00.790 line:0%
Here, here, here.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.180 line:0%
It's a little wet here.

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:17.170 line:0%
Wash that cloth.

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:18.720 line:0%
Wash it and then wipe again.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:23.410 line:0%
Sir, sir, your belt has fallen off.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:24.480 line:0%
Your belt has fallen off.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:25.280 line:0%
Belt.

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:40.530 line:0%
Did you two have a fight?

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:43.120 line:0%
No.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.540 line:0%
No?

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:45.520 line:0%
If not, then why

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:47.050 line:0%
did you suddenly come back?

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:50.290 line:0%
Come on, tell me.

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.200 line:0%
What have you done this time?

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:56.880 line:0%
My waist has gotten thinner again.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:58.340 line:0%
I need to keep working out.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:07.200 line:0%
I became a spy.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:09.150 line:0%
Are you out of...

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:13.380 line:0%
Are you out of your mind?

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:14.720 line:0%
I've heard that

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:16.560 line:0%
someone once snuck into the Shen's Mansion at night.

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:18.080 line:0%
Because they were a spy,

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:19.090 line:0%
in just one night,

00:22:19.280 --> 00:22:20.920 line:0%
not only did their body disappear,

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:22.710 line:0%
but their entire family...

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:27.920 line:0%
Their entire family vanished.

00:22:28.270 --> 00:22:29.300 line:0%
And

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:30.800 line:0%
in the middle of the night,

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:32.120 line:0%
people saw

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:34.160 line:0%
them being dragged by the ghost officer

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:35.890 line:0%
into the King of Hell's palace.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.880 line:0%
That's enough to wipe out an entire family.

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:39.740 line:0%
You're really brave, aren't you?

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:42.520 line:0%
Well, this matter...

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:46.760 line:0%
It's complicated.

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:49.010 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:22:49.030 --> 00:22:50.480 line:0%
What about the task I asked you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:51.480 line:0%
to have Xu handle?

00:22:51.500 --> 00:22:52.420 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:22:52.450 --> 00:22:53.600 line:0%
Commander Xu has already arranged for the constables

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:54.530 line:0%
to investigate.

00:22:55.400 --> 00:22:56.040 line:0%
Sir.

00:22:56.040 --> 00:22:57.360 line:0%
I'll go over there for a moment.

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:58.280 line:0%
It's alright.

00:22:58.560 --> 00:22:59.360 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.040 line:0%
I forgot to tell you something.

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:03.000 line:0%
Someone

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:03.840 line:0%
saw that your master

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:04.800 line:0%
returned from his travels,

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:05.960 line:0%
but as soon as he entered the city gates,

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:07.560 line:0%
he was taken away by the men

00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:08.620 line:0%
from the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:09.560 line:0%
What?

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:26.750 line:0%
Tell your Grand Commander to come out!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:27.970 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:29.850 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:35.040 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:35.720 line:0%
The Grand Commander is busy.

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:36.400 line:0%
He's not seeing anyone.

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:37.920 line:0%
I am the wife of your Grand Commander.

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:39.050 line:0%
Who dares to stop me?

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:41.120 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:23:41.200 --> 00:23:42.040 line:0%
Come out here!

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:43.100 line:0%
Throw her out.

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:44.200 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:23:44.220 --> 00:23:45.770 line:0%
If you have any issues, come at me.

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.370 line:0%
Why did you arrest my master?

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:51.160 line:0%
Don't think too highly of yourself.

00:23:51.470 --> 00:23:53.800 line:0%
You're overestimating your importance.

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:55.360 line:0%
Release my master.

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:56.260 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:58.140 line:0%
[Chen Wen]

00:23:56.720 --> 00:23:57.920 line:0%
Let my master go.

00:23:58.290 --> 00:23:59.930 line:0%
-Let my master go!
-Xing?

00:24:02.110 --> 00:24:03.070 line:0%
Master.

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:20.840 line:0%
Look at you.

00:24:21.080 --> 00:24:22.400 line:0%
You're a married woman now,

00:24:22.400 --> 00:24:23.840 line:0%
yet still so impulsive.

00:24:24.380 --> 00:24:26.110 line:0%
Master.

00:24:26.880 --> 00:24:28.640 line:0%
Please drink less in the future.

00:24:28.640 --> 00:24:30.180 line:0%
Especially, don't drink carelessly.

00:24:30.180 --> 00:24:31.340 line:0%
It's from others.

00:24:32.330 --> 00:24:33.760 line:0%
This disciple of mine

00:24:33.760 --> 00:24:35.040 line:0%
is very straightforward.

00:24:35.040 --> 00:24:37.320 line:0%
Grand Commander, I hope you will forgive her.

00:24:37.320 --> 00:24:38.120 line:0%
I understand.

00:24:38.600 --> 00:24:39.880 line:0%
What do you understand?

00:24:39.880 --> 00:24:40.730 line:0%
I...

00:24:46.040 --> 00:24:47.100 line:0%
That's enough.

00:24:47.130 --> 00:24:48.070 line:0%
Speak.

00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:51.000 line:0%
What do you want to ask me?

00:24:52.280 --> 00:24:53.640 line:0%
Master Chen, I heard that you developed a kind of

00:24:53.640 --> 00:24:54.720 line:0%
unique cinnabar.

00:24:55.120 --> 00:24:56.400 line:0%
Invisible when applied,

00:24:56.400 --> 00:24:57.440 line:0%
but visible when exposed to water.

00:24:57.440 --> 00:24:58.440 line:0%
That's correct.

00:24:58.520 --> 00:24:59.280 line:0%
It was originally

00:24:59.280 --> 00:25:01.880 line:0%
developed to prevent corpse decay.

00:25:02.060 --> 00:25:04.020 line:0%
I wonder if this special cinnabar

00:25:04.320 --> 00:25:05.960 line:0%
is exclusive to you?

00:25:06.240 --> 00:25:07.800 line:0%
Before I retired,

00:25:07.880 --> 00:25:09.080 line:0%
I gave this formula

00:25:09.080 --> 00:25:11.160 line:0%
to the servants of a few old friends.

00:25:11.180 --> 00:25:12.580 line:0%
It was used for pest control.

00:25:12.580 --> 00:25:14.140 line:0%
The effect was excellent.

00:25:14.160 --> 00:25:16.420 line:0%
Could you please tell me which families?

00:25:17.280 --> 00:25:18.320 line:0%
I understand now.

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:21.040 line:0%
Why is there such a big difference

00:25:21.040 --> 00:25:22.240 line:0%
between the time of disappearance

00:25:22.240 --> 00:25:24.700 line:0%
and the time of death determined by autopsy?

00:25:24.880 --> 00:25:25.960 line:0%
It can delay decay

00:25:25.960 --> 00:25:27.820 line:0%
and repel insects and avoid harm.

00:25:29.720 --> 00:25:31.170 line:0%
That's right, it's the cinnabar.

00:25:31.170 --> 00:25:33.200 line:0%
There were herbs placed around the corpses.

00:25:33.200 --> 00:25:34.000 line:0%
We originally thought

00:25:34.000 --> 00:25:35.950 line:0%
it was to mask the smell of decay.

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:37.400 line:0%
But actually, it contained

00:25:37.400 --> 00:25:39.080 line:0%
a special preservative cinnabar.

00:25:39.080 --> 00:25:39.760 line:0%
That's why the coroner's

00:25:39.760 --> 00:25:40.680 line:0%
examination of the time of death

00:25:40.680 --> 00:25:41.640 line:0%
was inaccurate.

00:25:45.500 --> 00:25:47.010 line:0%
Master.

00:25:50.640 --> 00:25:51.720 line:0%
Master Chen, I wonder if you

00:25:51.720 --> 00:25:52.480 line:0%
could calculate

00:25:52.480 --> 00:25:53.880 line:0%
the actual time of death.

00:25:54.720 --> 00:25:56.360 line:0%
As my disciple,

00:25:56.360 --> 00:25:58.820 line:0%
aren't you afraid of tiring out your master?

00:25:59.400 --> 00:26:00.740 line:0%
Master,

00:26:00.840 --> 00:26:02.280 line:0%
there's a wrongful conviction to solve.

00:26:02.280 --> 00:26:03.570 line:0%
Please put in some effort

00:26:03.570 --> 00:26:04.900 line:0%
and show us your skills.

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:06.550 line:0%
This round,

00:26:06.640 --> 00:26:08.120 line:0%
my master has won.

00:26:09.810 --> 00:26:10.620 line:0%
I won?

00:26:11.510 --> 00:26:12.310 line:0%
I won.

00:26:14.240 --> 00:26:15.200 line:0%
Let's go then.

00:26:15.200 --> 00:26:17.060 line:0%
-Take me to the morgue.
-Letâ€™s go.

00:26:18.160 --> 00:26:20.400 line:0%
-The morgue.
-Master, be careful.

00:26:32.760 --> 00:26:34.720 line:0%
My master, based on the level of preservation,

00:26:34.720 --> 00:26:35.640 line:0%
has roughly estimated

00:26:35.640 --> 00:26:37.240 line:0%
the actual time of death for the deceased.

00:26:36.370 --> 00:26:37.480 line:0%
[Time of Death at Ximing Temple]

00:26:38.800 --> 00:26:40.000 line:0%
Early spring of the 4th year of Shengli.

00:26:40.000 --> 00:26:41.240 line:0%
Midsummer of the 4th year of Shengli.

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:42.600 line:0%
February or March of the 5th year of Shengli.

00:26:42.600 --> 00:26:43.840 line:0%
June of the 6th year of Shengli.

00:26:43.840 --> 00:26:45.970 line:0%
Mid-August of the 6th year of Shengli.

00:26:47.440 --> 00:26:49.440 line:0%
Can't we narrow down the timeframe any further?

00:26:49.440 --> 00:26:50.790 line:0%
At this point,

00:26:50.920 --> 00:26:52.780 line:0%
there's no need for that anymore.

00:26:54.880 --> 00:26:57.880 line:0%
It was found in the male victim's stomach.

00:26:59.520 --> 00:27:01.500 line:0%
Based on the state of decomposition of the body,

00:27:01.500 --> 00:27:02.680 line:0%
I thought that even if

00:27:02.680 --> 00:27:04.640 line:0%
the victim had eaten before being killed,

00:27:04.640 --> 00:27:05.760 line:0%
the contents of the stomach

00:27:05.760 --> 00:27:06.680 line:0%
should have decomposed

00:27:06.680 --> 00:27:07.880 line:0%
along with the body.

00:27:09.120 --> 00:27:10.780 line:0%
I was too hasty in my judgment.

00:27:15.490 --> 00:27:19.120 line:0%
In forensic investigation, we shouldn't make assumptions beforehand.

00:27:19.120 --> 00:27:21.920 line:0%
The more bizarre and horrifying the scene,

00:27:21.920 --> 00:27:24.450 line:0%
the more we need to follow procedure step by step.

00:27:24.450 --> 00:27:25.290 line:0%
The key

00:27:25.650 --> 00:27:28.050 line:0%
is often hidden in some

00:27:28.360 --> 00:27:31.690 line:0%
inconspicuous details.

00:27:40.040 --> 00:27:40.840 line:0%
Melon seeds?

00:27:42.960 --> 00:27:43.760 line:0%
That's right.

00:27:47.440 --> 00:27:48.480 line:0%
Melon seeds can only be

00:27:48.480 --> 00:27:49.560 line:0%
digested and expelled

00:27:49.560 --> 00:27:50.760 line:0%
through intestinal movement

00:27:50.760 --> 00:27:51.760 line:0%
when a person is alive,

00:27:51.760 --> 00:27:52.720 line:0%
and it usually takes less than a day

00:27:52.720 --> 00:27:54.600 line:0%
for them to be completely expelled.

00:27:54.600 --> 00:27:57.010 line:0%
The fact that these victims all have melon seeds in their stomachs

00:27:57.010 --> 00:27:58.640 line:0%
indicates that they were killed

00:27:58.640 --> 00:28:00.440 line:0%
shortly after eating the seeds.

00:28:02.480 --> 00:28:04.160 line:0%
What seems logical

00:28:04.190 --> 00:28:06.120 line:0%
isn't necessarily true.

00:28:06.200 --> 00:28:09.640 line:0%
Sometimes, even what you see with your own eyes

00:28:09.640 --> 00:28:11.950 line:0%
may not be the truth.

00:28:12.040 --> 00:28:14.840 line:0%
It's possible that someone has used tricks

00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:18.400 line:0%
to make you believe it's the truth.

00:28:19.440 --> 00:28:20.600 line:0%
I've learned my lesson, Master.

00:28:20.600 --> 00:28:21.730 line:0%
What a coincidence.

00:28:22.080 --> 00:28:23.240 line:0%
All these male victims

00:28:23.240 --> 00:28:25.100 line:0%
ate melon seeds before they died?

00:28:27.000 --> 00:28:29.680 line:0%
Too many coincidences together

00:28:29.760 --> 00:28:31.880 line:0%
are no longer coincidences.

00:28:35.680 --> 00:28:36.680 line:0%
These melon seeds

00:28:37.080 --> 00:28:38.760 line:0%
are not from ordinary melons.

00:28:38.920 --> 00:28:40.360 line:0%
They're from Xichen's foreign melons.

00:28:40.360 --> 00:28:41.920 line:0%
The foreign melons from Xichen were tribute.

00:28:41.920 --> 00:28:43.240 line:0%
Aren't those only available in the imperial palace?

00:28:43.240 --> 00:28:43.880 line:0%
No.

00:28:44.720 --> 00:28:46.180 line:0%
There's another occasion

00:28:46.320 --> 00:28:47.560 line:0%
where these noble men

00:28:47.560 --> 00:28:50.080 line:0%
would have the chance to eat Xichen's melons.

00:28:50.080 --> 00:28:51.960 line:0%
The Day of Kaiyang.

00:28:54.350 --> 00:28:55.920 line:0%
The date of the Day of Kaiyang each year

00:28:55.920 --> 00:28:56.680 line:0%
is determined by the Imperial Astronomer's Office

00:28:56.680 --> 00:28:58.160 line:0%
through nighttime observation of the stars.

00:28:58.160 --> 00:28:59.840 line:0%
It's funded and organized by the government.

00:28:59.840 --> 00:29:00.600 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:29:00.600 --> 00:29:02.800 line:0%
will also bestow palace treasures on the spot.

00:29:02.800 --> 00:29:05.080 line:0%
It's just that the date is different every year.

00:29:05.080 --> 00:29:06.960 line:0%
So when is the next Day of Kaiyang?

00:29:08.060 --> 00:29:09.190 line:0%
Three days from now.

00:29:10.590 --> 00:29:13.660 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:29:17.840 --> 00:29:18.840 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:29:19.160 --> 00:29:21.240 line:0%
Her Majesty is still in a meeting.

00:29:21.580 --> 00:29:23.980 line:0%
Please be patient and wait a little longer.

00:29:40.440 --> 00:29:41.890 line:0%
The Buddha statue shed tears of blood.

00:29:41.890 --> 00:29:43.330 line:0%
Rumors are running rampant,

00:29:43.330 --> 00:29:45.750 line:0%
Her Majesty is suffering from a headache.

00:29:46.320 --> 00:29:47.680 line:0%
Even Princess Ying

00:29:48.080 --> 00:29:50.040 line:0%
has been implicated and confined.

00:29:53.470 --> 00:29:55.930 line:0%
I now announce Her Majesty's verbal decree.

00:29:59.850 --> 00:30:01.560 line:0%
The situation is grave now.

00:30:01.580 --> 00:30:02.600 line:0%
Within five days,

00:30:03.020 --> 00:30:04.780 line:0%
if the case is still not solved,

00:30:05.170 --> 00:30:07.680 line:0%
it will be handed over to the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:30:07.680 --> 00:30:08.480 line:0%
I

00:30:09.740 --> 00:30:12.140 line:0%
accept the order and express my gratitude.

00:30:21.060 --> 00:30:22.480 line:0%
Your Excellency, there's no need

00:30:22.480 --> 00:30:23.600 line:0%
to be so formal

00:30:23.640 --> 00:30:25.040 line:0%
every time you summon me.

00:30:25.320 --> 00:30:28.850 line:0%
I heard there were strange occurrences at Ximing Temple again.

00:30:29.040 --> 00:30:30.200 line:0%
It was man-made.

00:30:30.220 --> 00:30:32.400 line:0%
This nursery rhyme is just the beginning.

00:30:32.400 --> 00:30:33.800 line:0%
The situation is escalating.

00:30:33.800 --> 00:30:36.560 line:0%
Prince Xian's situation is worrisome.

00:30:37.080 --> 00:30:39.440 line:0%
I heard Princess Ying has also been confined.

00:30:39.440 --> 00:30:40.400 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:30:40.400 --> 00:30:41.320 line:0%
has disciplined all her children,

00:30:41.320 --> 00:30:42.520 line:0%
one by one.

00:30:42.690 --> 00:30:44.020 line:0%
I dare to ask,

00:30:44.160 --> 00:30:45.260 line:0%
are the blood tears on the Buddha statue

00:30:45.260 --> 00:30:46.690 line:0%
related to you, Your Excellency?

00:30:46.690 --> 00:30:47.680 line:0%
How dare you!

00:30:54.720 --> 00:30:56.520 line:0%
I apologize for my abrupt questioning.

00:30:56.520 --> 00:30:57.720 line:0%
I merely wish to uncover

00:30:57.720 --> 00:30:58.880 line:0%
the truth of the matter as soon as possible

00:30:58.880 --> 00:31:00.940 line:0%
to ease Your Excellency's concerns.

00:31:02.600 --> 00:31:05.040 line:0%
This matter is of no concern to me.

00:31:07.200 --> 00:31:08.150 line:0%
However,

00:31:08.400 --> 00:31:09.960 line:0%
regarding the matter I asked you to investigate,

00:31:09.960 --> 00:31:11.560 line:0%
what progress have you made?

00:31:12.150 --> 00:31:13.340 line:0%
I have not yet uncovered anything.

00:31:13.340 --> 00:31:14.870 line:0%
How dare you trifle with me!

00:31:14.920 --> 00:31:15.840 line:0%
Are you not afraid that I will

00:31:15.840 --> 00:31:17.600 line:0%
end your family's career in officialdom?

00:31:17.600 --> 00:31:19.880 line:0%
Please, Your Excellency, allow me to explain.

00:31:19.880 --> 00:31:21.600 line:0%
You asked me to investigate the pigeon coop,

00:31:21.600 --> 00:31:22.760 line:0%
undoubtedly to ascertain

00:31:22.760 --> 00:31:23.400 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager's

00:31:23.400 --> 00:31:25.040 line:0%
attitude towards Prince Xian.

00:31:25.040 --> 00:31:26.840 line:0%
Based on my investigation in the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:31:26.840 --> 00:31:29.300 line:0%
Your Excellency's concerns are unfounded.

00:31:29.560 --> 00:31:30.960 line:0%
How can you be so certain?

00:31:31.280 --> 00:31:32.280 line:0%
Besides the pigeon coop,

00:31:32.280 --> 00:31:33.760 line:0%
the communication routes of the Imperial Security Bureau

00:31:33.760 --> 00:31:34.760 line:0%
have suddenly increased.

00:31:34.760 --> 00:31:35.520 line:0%
Many of these are

00:31:35.520 --> 00:31:37.160 line:0%
false trails of midway returns,

00:31:37.160 --> 00:31:38.240 line:0%
designed to conceal

00:31:38.240 --> 00:31:39.400 line:0%
the true routes.

00:31:39.480 --> 00:31:40.240 line:0%
Furthermore,

00:31:40.240 --> 00:31:41.280 line:0%
a large number of Imperial Security Bureau troops

00:31:41.280 --> 00:31:42.880 line:0%
have been deployed outside the city,

00:31:42.880 --> 00:31:44.000 line:0%
presumably to ensure

00:31:44.000 --> 00:31:45.840 line:0%
Prince Xian's safety along the way.

00:31:45.840 --> 00:31:47.100 line:0%
If harm were intended,

00:31:47.120 --> 00:31:48.400 line:0%
why go to such lengths?

00:31:48.400 --> 00:31:49.800 line:0%
While that may be so,

00:31:51.080 --> 00:31:52.280 line:0%
it is merely your personal

00:31:52.280 --> 00:31:53.160 line:0%
assessment.

00:31:53.160 --> 00:31:54.560 line:0%
The danger to Prince Xian

00:31:54.880 --> 00:31:57.880 line:0%
is also your speculation, is it not, Your Excellency?

00:32:03.630 --> 00:32:05.030 line:0%
I'll believe you for now.

00:32:05.040 --> 00:32:06.240 line:0%
However, this matter

00:32:06.400 --> 00:32:08.160 line:0%
must be resolved immediately.

00:32:08.640 --> 00:32:09.720 line:0%
Rest assured, Your Excellency.

00:32:09.720 --> 00:32:11.120 line:0%
I will soon apprehend

00:32:11.120 --> 00:32:12.920 line:0%
the true culprit behind all this.

00:32:12.920 --> 00:32:14.380 line:0%
Good that you understand.

00:32:15.240 --> 00:32:16.680 line:0%
The order for transfer to the border desert

00:32:16.680 --> 00:32:18.160 line:0%
will be issued soon.

00:32:18.760 --> 00:32:20.960 line:0%
The time left for you and Dr. Yan

00:32:21.200 --> 00:32:22.160 line:0%
is running out.

00:32:40.240 --> 00:32:41.530 line:0%
[Zhang Baohuan, Deputy Minister of Rites]

00:32:41.280 --> 00:32:42.320 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:32:44.760 --> 00:32:45.960 line:0%
If you don't make a move,

00:32:45.960 --> 00:32:46.840 line:0%
this round

00:32:47.240 --> 00:32:48.880 line:0%
will be my victory.

00:32:51.320 --> 00:32:52.120 line:0%
Alright.

00:32:53.720 --> 00:32:55.230 line:0%
Well then,

00:32:55.720 --> 00:32:58.040 line:0%
I would like to request a reward from you.

00:32:58.480 --> 00:32:59.920 line:0%
Very well, tell me,

00:33:00.760 --> 00:33:02.080 line:0%
what do you want?

00:33:05.120 --> 00:33:06.800 line:0%
For this Kaiyang Festival,

00:33:06.800 --> 00:33:08.680 line:0%
thanks to your favor, Your Majesty,

00:33:08.680 --> 00:33:10.280 line:0%
I am to host it.

00:33:10.920 --> 00:33:13.520 line:0%
So, may I decide

00:33:14.240 --> 00:33:16.530 line:0%
whom to invite?

00:33:21.200 --> 00:33:22.720 line:0%
In past festivals,

00:33:22.840 --> 00:33:25.120 line:0%
guests would compose poems

00:33:25.120 --> 00:33:26.400 line:0%
and sing gentle songs.

00:33:27.920 --> 00:33:29.000 line:0%
This time,

00:33:29.160 --> 00:33:30.320 line:0%
could we invite

00:33:30.320 --> 00:33:32.400 line:0%
some true talents and beauties?

00:33:34.720 --> 00:33:37.640 line:0%
Invite whoever you want.

00:33:38.960 --> 00:33:40.140 line:0%
Have you

00:33:40.320 --> 00:33:42.760 line:0%
set your eyes on someone's daughter?

00:33:47.360 --> 00:33:48.310 line:0%
I

00:33:48.400 --> 00:33:50.040 line:0%
thank you, Your Majesty.

00:33:57.280 --> 00:33:58.080 line:0%
Madam Xu,

00:33:59.280 --> 00:34:00.720 line:0%
here's the list you gave me.

00:34:00.720 --> 00:34:01.880 line:0%
I've included all of them

00:34:01.880 --> 00:34:03.540 line:0%
in the list of invited guests.

00:34:04.200 --> 00:34:05.620 line:0%
Thank you for your assistance, Deputy Minister Zhang.

00:34:05.620 --> 00:34:06.550 line:0%
You're welcome.

00:34:06.690 --> 00:34:08.140 line:0%
In the future, I hope

00:34:08.170 --> 00:34:10.300 line:0%
you'll continue to show me some favor.

00:34:13.680 --> 00:34:14.600 line:0%
As a result,

00:34:14.269 --> 00:34:21.150 line:0%
[List of invitations for the Kaiyang Festival]

00:34:14.680 --> 00:34:16.680 line:0%
those who know the cinnabar formula

00:34:16.880 --> 00:34:18.280 line:0%
are all on the guest list

00:34:18.280 --> 00:34:19.740 line:0%
for the Kaiyang Festival.

00:34:22.050 --> 00:34:23.650 line:0%
The culprit is among them.

00:34:27.320 --> 00:34:29.999 line:0%
Finding the culprit from among these people

00:34:30.249 --> 00:34:32.180 line:0%
is not an easy task.

00:34:32.400 --> 00:34:33.240 line:0%
Instead,

00:34:33.360 --> 00:34:35.360 line:0%
we should let the culprit come to us.

00:34:35.430 --> 00:34:36.430 line:0%
This way, we can also save ourselves

00:34:36.430 --> 00:34:37.360 line:0%
a lot of trouble.

00:34:37.760 --> 00:34:39.240 line:0%
The deceased women

00:34:39.360 --> 00:34:41.240 line:0%
had similar appearances.

00:34:41.920 --> 00:34:42.950 line:0%
They were all skilled

00:34:42.950 --> 00:34:44.280 line:0%
pipa courtesans.

00:34:46.030 --> 00:34:48.360 line:0%
If I disguise myself like them

00:34:48.880 --> 00:34:50.240 line:0%
to attract the culprit's attention,

00:34:50.240 --> 00:34:51.990 line:0%
the culprit will naturally make a move.

00:34:51.459 --> 00:34:54.910 line:0%
[Soaring Ambition]

00:34:51.990 --> 00:34:52.640 line:0%
At that time,

00:34:52.640 --> 00:34:54.080 line:0%
you can catch them red-handed.

00:34:54.080 --> 00:34:54.800 line:0%
No,

00:34:55.280 --> 00:34:56.560 line:0%
it's too risky.

00:34:56.800 --> 00:34:57.720 line:0%
You can't go.

00:34:58.270 --> 00:34:58.750 line:0%
I...

00:34:59.080 --> 00:35:02.310 line:0%
[Soaring Ambition]

00:34:59.660 --> 00:35:01.230 line:0%
Go to Tongming House and choose someone

00:35:01.230 --> 00:35:02.920 line:0%
to dress up as the target.

00:35:03.230 --> 00:35:03.830 line:0%
Yes.

00:35:03.920 --> 00:35:04.640 line:0%
No.

00:35:06.340 --> 00:35:07.920 line:0%
The courtesans from Tongming House

00:35:07.920 --> 00:35:09.320 line:0%
are also ordinary citizens.

00:35:09.320 --> 00:35:10.120 line:0%
How can we

00:35:10.120 --> 00:35:11.520 line:0%
risk the lives of ordinary people?

00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:12.320 line:0%
Besides,

00:35:12.320 --> 00:35:13.280 line:0%
the culprit's methods

00:35:13.280 --> 00:35:14.280 line:0%
are so cruel.

00:35:14.400 --> 00:35:15.480 line:0%
If something were to happen,

00:35:15.480 --> 00:35:16.880 line:0%
how would you explain it to their families?

00:35:16.880 --> 00:35:18.610 line:0%
Since you know it's dangerous,

00:35:19.480 --> 00:35:20.760 line:0%
if you were to encounter danger,

00:35:20.760 --> 00:35:22.890 line:0%
how should I explain to Her Majesty...

00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:28.430 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang, and Dr. Yan?

00:35:35.820 --> 00:35:37.480 line:0%
[Soaring Ambition]

00:35:42.540 --> 00:35:43.520 line:0%
It's me who

00:35:43.580 --> 00:35:46.040 line:0%
insisted on thoroughly investigating this case.

00:35:46.040 --> 00:35:47.280 line:0%
If I hadn't intervened,

00:35:47.280 --> 00:35:49.160 line:0%
it would have been closed long ago.

00:35:49.160 --> 00:35:50.960 line:0%
Now we're just one step away,

00:35:51.000 --> 00:35:52.860 line:0%
I should see it through to the end.

00:35:53.480 --> 00:35:54.640 line:0%
For official investigations,

00:35:54.640 --> 00:35:57.570 line:0%
it's natural for an official like me to take the risk.

00:35:57.920 --> 00:35:59.400 line:0%
To put the lives of ordinary citizens

00:35:59.400 --> 00:36:00.160 line:0%
at risk,

00:36:00.160 --> 00:36:01.000 line:0%
I can't do it.

00:36:02.080 --> 00:36:03.340 line:0%
If you want to pretend,

00:36:03.560 --> 00:36:06.560 line:0%
you should also consider if you're qualified enough.

00:36:07.640 --> 00:36:09.600 line:0%
You need to be skilled at playing the pipa.

00:36:09.600 --> 00:36:10.640 line:0%
Can you play it?

00:37:03.840 --> 00:37:04.800 line:0%
I didn't realize, Madam,

00:37:04.800 --> 00:37:07.000 line:0%
that you were so talented in many areas.

00:37:09.920 --> 00:37:10.720 line:0%
How was it?

00:37:11.120 --> 00:37:12.450 line:0%
Would you say I can play?

00:37:13.160 --> 00:37:15.420 line:0%
Honey, your skills are truly exquisite.

00:37:21.360 --> 00:37:22.960 line:0%
Please play another piece.

00:37:31.060 --> 00:37:32.110 line:0%
I'm tired.

00:37:32.490 --> 00:37:33.480 line:0%
That's enough for today.

00:37:33.330 --> 00:37:35.390 line:0%
[Soaring Ambition]

00:37:33.480 --> 00:37:36.410 line:0%
Are you too tired or just unable to play other pieces?

00:37:38.280 --> 00:37:38.920 line:0%
When the time comes,

00:37:38.920 --> 00:37:41.180 line:0%
and you perform at the Kaiyang Festival,

00:37:41.880 --> 00:37:42.480 line:0%
do you plan

00:37:42.480 --> 00:37:44.680 line:0%
to just play these few phrases to get by?

00:38:04.360 --> 00:38:05.290 line:0%
I

00:38:05.400 --> 00:38:06.720 line:0%
haven't prepared well either.

00:38:06.720 --> 00:38:07.760 line:0%
I'll just say whatever comes to mind.

00:38:07.760 --> 00:38:08.640 line:0%
Let me give you

00:38:08.640 --> 00:38:09.640 line:0%
a few key points.

00:38:10.280 --> 00:38:11.880 line:0%
First, when you're playing,

00:38:12.120 --> 00:38:14.240 line:0%
this outfit isn't suitable.

00:38:14.840 --> 00:38:16.040 line:0%
You should dress

00:38:16.340 --> 00:38:17.340 line:0%
more lightly.

00:38:18.660 --> 00:38:21.730 line:0%
Is that really necessary?

00:38:23.080 --> 00:38:24.280 line:0%
The focus isn't on

00:38:24.280 --> 00:38:26.800 line:0%
how well you play the melody and rhythm.

00:38:26.800 --> 00:38:29.200 line:0%
It's about creating the right atmosphere.

00:38:30.920 --> 00:38:31.920 line:0%
Watch carefully.

00:38:33.040 --> 00:38:34.120 line:0%
You know all the poses, right?

00:38:34.120 --> 00:38:35.180 line:0%
The starting pose.

00:38:39.800 --> 00:38:40.800 line:0%
Extend your legs.

00:38:43.120 --> 00:38:44.380 line:0%
Then intertwine them.

00:38:44.520 --> 00:38:45.490 line:0%
Right.

00:38:45.600 --> 00:38:46.560 line:0%
Take it slow.

00:38:46.910 --> 00:38:47.870 line:0%
Now spin.

00:38:48.680 --> 00:38:49.760 line:0%
Keep spinning.

00:38:49.800 --> 00:38:50.600 line:0%
Swirling, swirling!

00:38:50.600 --> 00:38:52.880 line:0%
See how the dress flies up?

00:38:53.960 --> 00:38:55.990 line:0%
Make it fly, the dress!

00:38:56.040 --> 00:38:56.800 line:0%
Flowing gracefully!

00:38:56.800 --> 00:38:58.120 line:0%
Mother.

00:38:59.720 --> 00:39:01.320 line:0%
Can't you play while sitting down?

00:39:01.320 --> 00:39:02.720 line:0%
You keep swaying around.

00:39:02.720 --> 00:39:04.980 line:0%
I can't even see your fingering clearly.

00:39:06.270 --> 00:39:08.470 line:0%
The finger technique is not important.

00:39:09.080 --> 00:39:10.160 line:0%
What comes next is important.

00:39:10.160 --> 00:39:11.160 line:0%
Watch carefully.

00:39:12.520 --> 00:39:15.280 line:0%
Raise your hands above your head.

00:39:18.520 --> 00:39:21.320 line:0%
Bring them down behind your head.

00:39:25.520 --> 00:39:27.400 line:0%
Your posture should be alluring.

00:39:27.400 --> 00:39:28.240 line:0%
Show your face.

00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:29.640 line:0%
The eyes. Look at my eyes.

00:39:29.640 --> 00:39:31.690 line:0%
A woman's charm.

00:39:31.880 --> 00:39:33.400 line:0%
Focus, focus on the eyes.

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:34.600 line:0%
Look at my eyes.

00:39:39.400 --> 00:39:40.160 line:0%
That's right.

00:39:40.160 --> 00:39:41.440 line:0%
Pay attention, focus on this part.

00:39:41.440 --> 00:39:42.600 line:0%
Now rotate.

00:39:48.260 --> 00:39:49.770 line:0%
Give a full-body shiver.

00:39:52.280 --> 00:39:53.390 line:0%
If it goes smoothly,

00:39:53.390 --> 00:39:54.880 line:0%
this should have already

00:39:54.880 --> 00:39:56.800 line:0%
fallen to the ground.

00:39:58.430 --> 00:40:00.170 line:0%
Mother.

00:40:00.360 --> 00:40:01.720 line:0%
You can dance later.

00:40:01.750 --> 00:40:02.630 line:0%
Sit down first.

00:40:02.650 --> 00:40:04.810 line:0%
I just want to learn a song seriously.

00:40:06.400 --> 00:40:07.760 line:0%
It's not about the quantity of songs,

00:40:07.760 --> 00:40:08.690 line:0%
but the quality.

00:40:09.120 --> 00:40:10.200 line:0%
Your mother,

00:40:10.400 --> 00:40:12.600 line:0%
back then, just knew one song.

00:40:12.600 --> 00:40:13.840 line:0%
A true master

00:40:13.840 --> 00:40:15.760 line:0%
doesn't need a second one.

00:40:16.200 --> 00:40:17.280 line:0%
And your father

00:40:17.360 --> 00:40:19.360 line:0%
never lasted until

00:40:19.360 --> 00:40:20.290 line:0%
the second song.

00:40:20.720 --> 00:40:21.720 line:0%
Well, Mother.

00:40:23.040 --> 00:40:25.040 line:0%
What are you talking about?

00:40:25.920 --> 00:40:27.360 line:0%
The one I just taught you,

00:40:27.360 --> 00:40:27.960 line:0%
that one...

00:40:27.960 --> 00:40:29.520 line:0%
Once the pipa rebound is finished,

00:40:29.520 --> 00:40:30.360 line:0%
a man

00:40:30.440 --> 00:40:32.200 line:0%
simply can't control himself anymore.

00:40:32.200 --> 00:40:33.240 line:0%
Mother.

00:40:33.720 --> 00:40:34.400 line:0%
I just want to

00:40:34.400 --> 00:40:35.640 line:0%
learn a pipa song seriously.

00:40:35.640 --> 00:40:37.170 line:0%
I use it for investigation.

00:40:37.650 --> 00:40:39.250 line:0%
What did you think it was for?

00:40:41.400 --> 00:40:42.320 line:0%
I thought

00:40:42.560 --> 00:40:44.240 line:0%
you wanted me to teach you some

00:40:44.240 --> 00:40:45.480 line:0%
bedroom pleasures

00:40:45.480 --> 00:40:47.210 line:0%
and Pipa skills for enjoyment.

00:40:49.680 --> 00:40:50.900 line:0%
No.

00:40:55.520 --> 00:40:56.680 line:0%
Uncle,

00:40:56.840 --> 00:40:58.000 line:0%
tell me, what does my mother

00:40:58.000 --> 00:40:59.520 line:0%
think about every day?

00:40:59.680 --> 00:41:01.080 line:0%
Just because I'm married,

00:41:01.080 --> 00:41:02.480 line:0%
does everything I think and do

00:41:02.480 --> 00:41:03.640 line:0%
have to revolve around

00:41:03.640 --> 00:41:05.120 line:0%
how to please my husband?

00:41:05.120 --> 00:41:06.640 line:0%
Your mother was sent

00:41:06.680 --> 00:41:08.000 line:0%
to the theater from a young age.

00:41:08.000 --> 00:41:09.000 line:0%
The theater troupe leader then

00:41:09.000 --> 00:41:10.000 line:0%
taught us

00:41:10.760 --> 00:41:12.220 line:0%
to be extremely tolerant,

00:41:13.240 --> 00:41:14.560 line:0%
humble ourselves,

00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:16.920 line:0%
and entertain people with our voices and appearances.

00:41:16.920 --> 00:41:19.320 line:0%
Fortunately, your father took pity on her,

00:41:19.420 --> 00:41:20.970 line:0%
giving her

00:41:21.400 --> 00:41:22.660 line:0%
a place to settle down.

00:41:23.870 --> 00:41:25.280 line:0%
So in your mother's eyes,

00:41:26.080 --> 00:41:27.240 line:0%
the best destiny she could think of

00:41:27.240 --> 00:41:29.400 line:0%
for her daughter is

00:41:30.530 --> 00:41:32.730 line:0%
to find a good man to spend her life with.

00:41:34.120 --> 00:41:35.850 line:0%
Then by my mother's standards,

00:41:36.080 --> 00:41:37.240 line:0%
I certainly don't have

00:41:37.240 --> 00:41:38.520 line:0%
a good destiny.

00:41:39.160 --> 00:41:40.910 line:0%
The one I married is not a good man.

00:41:40.910 --> 00:41:42.930 line:0%
Your mother has sent me messages many times,

00:41:42.930 --> 00:41:44.370 line:0%
asking me to

00:41:44.640 --> 00:41:46.440 line:0%
intercede for you in the palace,

00:41:46.680 --> 00:41:48.810 line:0%
and never to let that White...

00:41:52.170 --> 00:41:53.370 line:0%
I mean, your husband,

00:41:54.190 --> 00:41:55.350 line:0%
harm your life.

00:41:55.760 --> 00:41:56.540 line:0%
But now that you're

00:41:56.540 --> 00:41:57.660 line:0%
safe and sound,

00:41:57.810 --> 00:41:59.100 line:0%
she's at ease.

00:42:00.320 --> 00:42:02.040 line:0%
But she spends all day thinking about

00:42:02.040 --> 00:42:04.300 line:0%
how to make your position as the mistress

00:42:04.440 --> 00:42:05.440 line:0%
more secure.

00:42:06.080 --> 00:42:08.000 line:0%
Mother is really overthinking it.

00:42:08.000 --> 00:42:09.360 line:0%
This position of mistress,

00:42:09.360 --> 00:42:11.560 line:0%
whoever wants it can have it.

00:42:12.720 --> 00:42:14.640 line:0%
I don't need a man's protection.

00:42:16.040 --> 00:42:17.080 line:0%
I only hope

00:42:18.080 --> 00:42:19.080 line:0%
I can become

00:42:19.080 --> 00:42:20.400 line:0%
a strong woman

00:42:21.600 --> 00:42:22.930 line:0%
who can protect herself

00:42:23.880 --> 00:42:24.880 line:0%
and her family.

00:42:25.280 --> 00:42:26.080 line:0%
I, Yan Xing,

00:42:26.080 --> 00:42:27.400 line:0%
was fortunate enough to be born in

00:42:27.400 --> 00:42:29.400 line:0%
a dynasty where women can hold official positions.

00:42:29.400 --> 00:42:31.400 line:0%
There's no need to serve others with my looks.

00:42:31.400 --> 00:42:33.170 line:0%
However, at present,

00:42:34.000 --> 00:42:35.960 line:0%
I do need

00:42:36.430 --> 00:42:37.640 line:0%
a pipa performance that can attract

00:42:37.640 --> 00:42:39.920 line:0%
all the spectators below the stage.

00:42:42.770 --> 00:42:44.020 line:0%
You just said

00:42:45.530 --> 00:42:47.130 line:0%
it's for the investigation.

00:42:48.440 --> 00:42:49.200 line:0%
I need to

00:42:49.200 --> 00:42:50.800 line:0%
perform a pipa piece

00:42:50.800 --> 00:42:52.360 line:0%
on the stage of Liushang House

00:42:52.360 --> 00:42:54.240 line:0%
to draw out the culprit.